{
  "id": "GEN.34",
  "number": "34",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Omochakano 34",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "34",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sekemu ogosaria Dina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Dina, omoiseke o Lea, oyio Lea aiborerete Yakobo, akagenda kororana nabaiseke b’ense eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Sekemu, omwana o Hamori Omohivi, omonene bw’ense eria, amorooche, akamobwata, akaba nere, akamosareria obwekungi bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende magega y’ayio agakorera Dina, omoiseke oyio o Yakobo, buya, akamwancha na gokwana nere amang’ana amaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekemu agakwana na Hamori ise, akamoteebia: “Mborerie omoiseke oyo abe mokane!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yakobo achia koigwa ng’a Sekemu osaririe Dina, omoiseke oye, abamura baye ngetii baarenge korisia, Ase igo Yakobo agakira‐kiri goika bakairana inka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamori, ise Sekemu, akaimoka akagenda o Yakobo gokwana nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamura ba Yakobo, ekero bachia koigwa ayio, bagacha korwa getii, bare nobororo na ekeririanda ekenene mono, ekiagera Sekemu akorete obokayayu ase Abaisraeli ase okomotachera inse omoiseke o Yakobo, ring’ana ritagwenerete gokoreka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamori agakwana nabarabwo, akabora: “Omomura one Sekemu omwanchire omoiseke oino, bono komoranche, momomoe amonyuome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyuomerane intwe nainwe, motoe abaiseke baino, naintwe tobae abaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe nabo moramenye egati yaito, aiga ase ense yaito ribaga ndireo ase more, moramenye na koonchoreria, mwenyorere enibo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekemu agateebia ise Dina na bamura bamwabo: “Nyanchere aya naboria aase more, kende gionsi moramboorie nimbae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mboorie enibo ende yonsi na ebiegwa boigo, nimbae buna moraganie, kogicha mong’e omoiseke oyo abe mokane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abamura ba Yakobo bakairaneria Sekemu na Hamori ise ase okong’ainereria, ekiagera konya osaririe Dina, omoiseke omwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakairaneria: “Titokonyara gokora ring’ana eri, komoa omonto otaarogeti, omoiseke ominto, ekiagera ayio nigo arabe aya obosooku ase tore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natonyare gwancha okoboria kwaino ase ring’ana erimo rioka, naende nario eri: Komoranche mobe buna intwe, kera omonto omosacha ore asemore aarokigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ’natobae abaiseke baito, na intwe toire abaino, tomenye amo, tobe abanto abamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende motancheti mwarokigwe, rirorio nigo torarusie omoiseke oito aa, togende nere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana abo akagwenera Hamori na omomura oye Sekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omomura oyio tatebana gokora ring’ana riria, ekiagera omoiseke oria o Yakobo konya omogweneire. Bono Sekemu nigo asikire kobua abande bonsi ase eamate yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo, Hamori na Sekemu, omomura oye, bakagenda ase egeita ki’omochie obo, bagakwana nabaanto babo, bakabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanto aba babeire abasani baito, tiga bamenye ase ense yaito, babe abaonchoreria, ekiagera ense eye nenene, netoisane twensi, intwe amo na barabwo. Intwe ntonyuomerane na barabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo banchire komenya seito babe obomo naintwe, korende mbaganetie tokore ring’ana erimo, nario eri, ng’a kera omosacha ore ase tore aarokigwe buna barabwo baarogete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaicho abo, na enibo yabo, na etugo yabo yonsi, inee, tibikoba ebiaito? Tiga twancherane nabarabwo rioka, bamenye aa seito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi abamenyete ase omochie oria, bakaigwera Hamori na omomura oye Sekemu, na kera omosacha oyomenyeteo akaarokigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abamura ba Yakobo bagoakana abanto ba Sekemu egesiomba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria gatato ekero abwo baarogete baarenge koromwa mono, abamura babere ba Yakobo, Simioni na Lawi, bamura ba ng’ina omo na Dina, bakaimoka nemeyio ya birende, bagasoa ase omochie ime mobosokano, bagaita abasacha bonsi abaarengeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagaita Hamori amo na Sekemu momura oye nemeyio ya birende, bakarusia Dina omwabo mwa Sekemu, bakagenda nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abamura bande ba Yakobo bagachiera abwo baitetwe na bagasakora omochie, ekiagera konya basaririe omoiseke omwabo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaira ching’ondi, ne chiombe, ne chitigere, na bionsi ebiareenge ase omochie ime, na bionsi ebiareenge ase emegondo boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagasakora enibo yabo yonsi, na abana babo, na abakungu babo, na bionsi ebiareenge ase chinyomba bakabiira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yakobo agateebia Simioni na Lawi: “Inwe mwambekire ase emechando, mwankorire ogotioka okobe egati-gati y’abanto b’ebisaku bi’ense eye, Abakaanani na Abaperisi. Inche na abanto baane nabake tore; barabwo baise gosangererekana na kong’umokera nigo barang’ite na gonsiria amo nabaanto baane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende barabwo bakamoiraneria: “Inee! Nabo barabwo bagwenerete bakorere omoiseke ominto buna omokungu omotayayi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
